
                       geant4-11-04-ref-07
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Parallelised EstimateCubicVolume() and EstimateSurfaceArea() calculations
   in G4VSolid, using the tasking infrastructure on demand.
 o Parallelised GetMass() calculation G4LogicalVolume for independent daughter
   contributions using the tasking infrastructure on demand.
 o Optimised G4Polycone, G4GenericPolycone and G4Polyhedra queries with
   solid-specific RZ/phi fast paths, cached phi-boundary trigonometry and
   flattened Z/RZ candidate tables allocated only for large solids.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

cmake                                            cmake-V11-04-05
-----
- Fix to escape special characters so they don't get interpreted as regex
  directives, so that a build path containing valid but special characters
  like "+", don't get module composition step failing due to use of regexing,
  as proposed in [GitHub PR #102](https://github.com/Geant4/geant4/pull/102).
  Addressing problem report #2744. 

geometry
--------
- divisions (geomdiv-V11-04-00)
  o Fix in G4VDivisionParameterisation to cure a double-free in MT mode.
    ChangeRotMatrix() assigned one thread-local rotation matrix to multiple
    division physical volumes; as each replica owns and deletes its rotation
    during worker teardown, this was producing a double-free. The fix reuses
    the per-volume rotation matrix already allocated by G4PVReplica, resets
    it before applying each phi rotation and removes the shared thread-local
    rotation and G4AutoDelete registration.
- management (geommng-V11-04-10)
  o Parallelised G4VSolid::EstimateCubicVolume() and EstimateSurfaceArea()
    using the tasking infrastructure on demand, splitting Monte Carlo samples
    into deterministic chunks with local random streams and reductions.
  o Parallelised G4LogicalVolume::GetMass() for independent daughter
    contributions using the tasking infrastructure on demand.
    Warm cubic-volume caches before parallel mass traversal, avoiding lock
    ordering deadlocks in lazily computed composed solids while preserving
    on-demand initialisation.
  o Added G4GeomTaskHelper to factorise setup and cleanup of geometry tasking
    thread pools, PTL thread data and registered task-local workspace callbacks.
    Added an independent seed stream and G4QuickRand seeding helper for
    on-demand geometry calculations, avoiding use of the simulation random
    engine.
  o Added G4GeometryManager switches to force serial processing for GetMass(),
    GetPointOnSurface() related estimates and geometry overlap checks.
  o Fixed segmentation fault in G4GeomSplitter; offset is defined as
    thread-local, but its allocation capacity was tracked globally. A second
    thread therefore could believe storage was already allocated, leaving its
    own offset null before dereferencing it. Addressing problem report #2747.
- navigation (geomnav-V11-04-06)
  o Reuse G4GeomTaskHelper in G4GeomTestVolume to share the tasking pool,
    PTL thread-data and task-local geometry workspace setup with geometry
    management code while preserving the overlap-check execution policy.
    Use the independent G4GeomTaskHelper seed stream for parallel overlap
    checks and composed-solid surface warm-up, avoiding use of the simulation
    random engine.
  o Added /geometry/test UI commands to force serial processing for
    GetMass(), GetPointOnSurface() related estimates and overlap checks.
- solids/CSG (geom-csg-V11-04-01)
  o In G4Cons::GetPointOnSurface(), uses G4QuickRand instead of CLHEP
    RandFlat, keeping surface sampling on the geometry quick-random stream.
- solids/specific (geom-specific-V11-04-05)
  o G4SolidsWorkspace now registers task-local workspace setup and cleanup
    callbacks with G4GeomTaskHelper.
  o Use area-weighted point-on-surface sampling for G4VCSGfaceted and
    G4TessellatedSolid without adding persistent cumulative area tables;
    G4TessellatedSolid now samples facets proportionally to facet area.
  o Fixed lazy initialisation races for point-on-surface surface-element
    tables in G4GenericPolycone, G4Polycone and G4Polyhedra.
  o Strengthened lazy cache initialisation for faceted and tessellated solids,
    computing area/volume in local temporaries before publishing cached values.
  o Optimised G4Polycone, G4GenericPolycone and G4Polyhedra queries with
    solid-specific RZ/phi fast paths, cached phi-boundary trigonometry and
    flattened Z/RZ candidate tables allocated only for large solids.
    Added an analytic exact-vector-distance path for G4Polycone using cached
    cone sections, Z-directed section traversal and integrated phi-plane tests.
    Removed atan2() from G4Polyhedra/G4PolyhedraSide segment selection and
    improved G4IntersectingCone line intersections.
  o Reduced G4VCSGfaceted exact-distance and safety overhead with Z-section
    indexing, early candidate rejection and stack-backed visited tracking.
  o Extended G4Voxelizer to support voxelisation along a subset of axes.
- volumes (geomvol-V11-04-01)
  o G4PVPlacement overlap checking now seeds only the independent geometry
    quick-random stream through G4GeomTaskHelper, avoiding temporary
    replacement of the simulation random engine.
  o G4GeometryWorkspace now registers task-local workspace setup and cleanup
    callbacks with G4GeomTaskHelper.

